# Anime Filler Checker — optional environment variables
#
# The add-on works with NO configuration at all. This file documents the only
# optional switch that exists. For local development you can copy this file to
# `.env`; on Vercel use Project Settings → Environment Variables instead.

# Set to 1 to also expose an informational WebVTT "badge" subtitle track that
# briefly shows the verdict at the start of playback.
# Off by default, because it makes the add-on appear in Stremio's subtitle
# picker for every episode of a matched anime. The main stream-row feature
# works with or without this.
# ENABLE_SUBTITLE_BADGE=1
